msgctxt "badend5:badend5_BBEF13A2_BB0F_4A79_B501_E9A68ED3ECA9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫"
"You’ve made the right decision, Michel."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫그래"
"요……, ⟪k:17⟫그거면 돼요, ⟪k:18⟫미셸."

#: badend5:badend5_83564003_4394_490F_B68B_0F69DF183169
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 63715cc3502b76c55daccd9de3787d1811ba04ab8d00defe9e5d13df7caaf8d8
#. default-sha256: c201c06e06e269a20838d58c31baccd43f5ce51a6b6669601011d730656a3e36
msgctxt "badend5:badend5_83564003_4394_490F_B68B_0F69DF183169"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Your tragic tale has finally come to an end."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이제―― 당신의 고행도 끝이에요."

#: badend5:badend5_B76F5D6E_10F3_4739_9D24_003030A012AB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 858e8a615807071236a78f726122fa74667175218e6f166759895a5254ef545b
