msgid "⟪k:0⟫richly fulfilling and abounding in light."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫제가…… 당신의 좋은 인생을 ⟪k:1⟫기도해 드릴게요."

#: badend5:badend5_60370D30_8D56_42CF_B457_4881616FC1D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8f40cbf6639a01afbc6393182d8a783eb4ff3a9d251c469d67a4aac1d3640424
