"⟪k:0⟫I’ve been trying to get your attention for some time,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but you were just staring off "
"into the distance."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫왠지 ⟪k:1⟫많이 멍해 보이시길래…….⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫제가…… ⟪k:4⟫여러 번 불렀는데요……."

