msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……으음……, ⟪k:1⟫무슨 얘기를…… 하고 있었죠."

#: badend5:badend5_22A3A367_B50D_46BE_8D2A_00044CB8B667
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 48597f5f47c8e149e1e4807472feaddc16a08fc153a561f013ef0ffa95e9b260
