msgctxt "badend5:badend5_22A3A367_B50D_46BE_8D2A_00044CB8B667"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Are you sure you’re okay?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I was saying we need to settle on a destination for our "
"trip next month."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……정말로 괜찮으세요……?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그게, ⟪k:3⟫다음 달 여행지를…… ⟪k:4⟫정하기로 했잖아요."

#: badend5:badend5_86396821_A704_466D_BDC8_B9DA192F8AC1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2be166878bfbccfdbe4e005ab9af74ad859c8958796d6231c74e089d95963ac5
