msgctxt "badend5:badend5_86396821_A704_466D_BDC8_B9DA192F8AC1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Ahh... ⟪k:1⟫Anywhere you’d like is fine with me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……아아……, ⟪k:1⟫당신이…… 가고 싶은 곳이면 됩니다."

#: badend5:badend5_7B84C3A8_4D0F_4F9F_BAC2_E5C67DB83917
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7bb9860b5c474b40e6b3fa7df1d0f0cec8cd651a0044f1faa20bc4ff27ad736f
